958:926	/reference/reference-semantics/semantics/tuple.k	52	RULE	priority	rule <k> Assign(TupleExpr(TS:Exprs), ref(H:Int)) => Assign(TupleExpr(TS), V) ... </k> <heap> ... H |-> V:Val ... </heap> [priority(40)]

